{"id":"c042","number":42,"title":"你自己说","label":"第四十二章 你自己说","volumeId":"v2","sourceHeadingParagraph":10323,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"周四早上七点十三分，手机的震动把程野从睡梦之中拽醒。","sourceParagraph":10324},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整间宿舍尚且沉在黎明的安静里。窗帘没有完全拉拢，清晨灰调的天光顺着缝隙钻进来，在地板上割开一道细长冷白的光痕。昨夜不知是谁临睡前推开半扇窗户，整夜晚风穿堂而过，摊放在桌面的几张打印纸边角被吹得向上翘起，时不时轻轻颤栗，发出几不可闻的沙沙细响。","sourceParagraph":10325},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野缓缓掀开眼皮，混沌的睡意还蒙住神志，一时分不清是什么将自己惊扰。枕边的手机依旧持续低沉震颤。他伸出手臂，指尖摸索着捞过机身。","sourceParagraph":10326},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屏幕亮起，是父亲发来的消息，并没有拨来电话。","sourceParagraph":10327},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天不用来。」","sourceParagraph":10328},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野平躺在床上，目光落在这行字上，残留的困意一点点从四肢百骸褪去。","sourceParagraph":10329},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没过几秒，第二条消息接续弹出来。","sourceParagraph":10330},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「检查做完我告诉你。」","sourceParagraph":10331},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他的视线停留在末尾那五个字上。昨天离开病房之前，他曾经认认真真叮嘱过两遍，等检查结束一定要给自己发消息。此刻距离正式开始检查尚且很早，父亲便提前给出这样一句许诺。","sourceParagraph":10332},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野唇角极细微地向上牵动，转瞬又被他压下去。手指在屏幕上敲下回复。","sourceParagraph":10333},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「几点。」","sourceParagraph":10334},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「不知道。」","sourceParagraph":10335},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「护士没有说时间吗。」","sourceParagraph":10336},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「九点以后。」","sourceParagraph":10337},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「那我下午过去。」","sourceParagraph":10338},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消息发送出去，对面回复来得十分干脆。","sourceParagraph":10339},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是跟你说了不用过来。」","sourceParagraph":10340},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的指尖悬停在屏幕表面，微微顿住。","sourceParagraph":10341},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「充电器我给你送过去。」","sourceParagraph":10342},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「楼下小卖部随手就能买一个。」","sourceParagraph":10343},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「我已经买好了。」","sourceParagraph":10344},{"type":"paragraph","text":"对话框沉寂了很长一段时间，屏幕光标反复闪烁，终于只传回简简单单一个字。","sourceParagraph":10345},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":10346},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野凝视屏幕上这一个字，心底忽然生出一种似曾相识的微妙感受。他把手机平放在胸口，合上眼皮试着再睡一会儿，可脑子里思绪纷乱，再也无法沉入睡眠。","sourceParagraph":10347},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上午有一节专业课。","sourceParagraph":10349},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野拣了教室后排的位置坐下。投影幕布投射出访谈技术的讲义，一行行文字规整地铺展开：不要替对方回答；允许对话之中出现沉默；不要因为氛围不适，就急着用话语填满所有空白。","sourceParagraph":10350},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他目光落在这几行提示上，心底隐隐泛起一点浅淡的自嘲笑意。","sourceParagraph":10351},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好像身边所有人，都在慢慢学着这套相处的方式。幕不会替他做决定，不会逼迫他给出答复；沈砚也不会贸然替他定义内心的恐惧。就连自己，也慢慢懂得抛出问题之后，可以安静等候，不必对方一陷入沉默，就慌忙收回问句。","sourceParagraph":10352},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师翻动幻灯片，页面切换的微光淡淡扫过教室。","sourceParagraph":10353},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野把手机搁在课本旁边，视线时不时无意识飘向漆黑的屏幕。","sourceParagraph":10354},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九点十四分。","sourceParagraph":10355},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九点四十分。","sourceParagraph":10356},{"type":"paragraph","text":"十点零五分。","sourceParagraph":10357},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前后一共抬起来看过三次。","sourceParagraph":10358},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第三次他刚刚点亮屏幕，身侧的同学偏过头，目光带着一点好奇扫过来。","sourceParagraph":10359},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「在等消息？」","sourceParagraph":10360},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野身体微微一僵，指尖下意识按住手机外壳。","sourceParagraph":10361},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10362},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「女朋友？」","sourceParagraph":10363},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突如其来的猜测，让他险些呛住呼吸。","sourceParagraph":10364},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是。」","sourceParagraph":10365},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同学拖长语调“哦”了一声，脸上明明白白写着全然不信的神色。","sourceParagraph":10366},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野懒得再多做辩解，将手机倒扣在桌面上。落下之后又迟疑一瞬，重新把屏幕翻向上方，任由它静静躺在课本旁边。","sourceParagraph":10367},{"type":"paragraph","text":"十一点二十三，消息终于推送过来。","sourceParagraph":10369},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「做完一项。」","sourceParagraph":10370},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消息下方附带一张实拍照片。白瓷小碗盛着清寡的白粥，一旁摆放两格小小的塑料餐盒，一盒咸菜，一盒水煮蛋，是医院食堂标准的病号餐。","sourceParagraph":10371},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野盯着照片看了片刻。","sourceParagraph":10372},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「发这个是干什么。」","sourceParagraph":10373},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「医院的午饭。」","sourceParagraph":10374},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「我看得出来。」","sourceParagraph":10375},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「味道还行。」","sourceParagraph":10376},{"type":"paragraph","text":"望着那句轻描淡写的“还行”，程野一时竟不知该如何回应。他心里惦记检查的结果，却也清楚此刻报告尚未产出。斟酌许久，只敲出一句。","sourceParagraph":10377},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「鸡蛋吃掉。」","sourceParagraph":10378},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「吃了。」","sourceParagraph":10379},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「不要只喝粥。」","sourceParagraph":10380},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲：「你好好上课。」","sourceParagraph":10381},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野眉头浅浅蹙起。","sourceParagraph":10382},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「已经下课了。」","sourceParagraph":10383},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消息发出之后，对话框便归于沉寂。","sourceParagraph":10384},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他收起手机走出教学楼。正午日光已经十分炽烈，台阶被晒得泛出一片刺目的灰白。夏蝉尚且还没有拉开声势，只有草丛深处，断断续续飘来几声短促细碎的虫鸣。五月的风褪去春日的清寒，拂过脸颊，裹着一层薄薄温热的气息。","sourceParagraph":10385},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他站在教学楼投下的树荫底下，迟疑片刻，还是点开和沈砚的对话框。","sourceParagraph":10386},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「上午做完一项检查。」","sourceParagraph":10387},{"type":"paragraph","text":"几分钟之后沈砚回复。","sourceParagraph":10388},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「结果出来了吗。」","sourceParagraph":10389},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还没有。」","sourceParagraph":10390},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你下午几点过去。」","sourceParagraph":10391},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「我一点半动身。」","sourceParagraph":10392},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚：「我三点下课。」","sourceParagraph":10393},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野敲完一行字，目光停顿片刻，又特意补上一句。","sourceParagraph":10394},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你慢慢来，不用赶时间。」","sourceParagraph":10395},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚只回：「知道。」","sourceParagraph":10396},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没有满口应允，也没有说自己会尽量提早。看见这句回复，程野心头那点悬着的重量，反倒轻轻卸下去几分。","sourceParagraph":10397},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下午两点四十，程野抵达医院病房。","sourceParagraph":10399},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日病房里比昨日喧闹不少。靠门床位已经住进新的病患，三名家属围在床边。一名中年女人坐在凳上削苹果，水果刀顺着果皮缓缓旋动，一整条红艳果皮垂落，晃晃悠悠悬在半空。窗边还站着一名年轻男人压低声音通电话，零碎的词句“结果”、“医生”、“明天”顺着空气漫散开。","sourceParagraph":10400},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲穿着病号服，外面随意披了一件自己的薄外套，坐在病床边沿低头看着手机。听见脚步声靠近，他抬眼望过来，视线第一时间落在程野手中拎着的塑料袋上。","sourceParagraph":10401},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「当真买了？」","sourceParagraph":10402},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野走上前，将崭新的充电器放到床头柜。","sourceParagraph":10403},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然还能是假的。」","sourceParagraph":10404},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲拿起包装盒打量。","sourceParagraph":10405},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「多少钱。」","sourceParagraph":10406},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不用管这个。」","sourceParagraph":10407},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「别买太贵的东西。」","sourceParagraph":10408},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野拉开椅子落座。","sourceParagraph":10409},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「四十九，带充电头整套。」","sourceParagraph":10410},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲眉头立刻拧起。","sourceParagraph":10411},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一根数据线要四十九？」","sourceParagraph":10412},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「整套配件。」","sourceParagraph":10413},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那也偏贵。」","sourceParagraph":10414},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你要不拿去退掉。」","sourceParagraph":10415},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲被这句话噎得无言，把包装盒搁到柜子上。隔了一小会儿，又重新拿起来，动手拆开封膜。","sourceParagraph":10416},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野看着他的动作，唇角一点点漾开笑意。","sourceParagraph":10417},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「刚刚还在嫌价钱贵。」","sourceParagraph":10418},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「既然买回来了，放着不用才是浪费。」","sourceParagraph":10419},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野轻轻“哦”了一声。","sourceParagraph":10420},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬眼瞥向他。","sourceParagraph":10421},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你最近怎么总学别人说“哦”。」","sourceParagraph":10422},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野笑意更深。","sourceParagraph":10423},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「跟别人学的。」","sourceParagraph":10424},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「跟谁。」","sourceParagraph":10425},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不认识。」","sourceParagraph":10426},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲没有继续追问，把充电头插进墙面插座确认可以正常使用，再将旧数据线从手机上拔下，仔细卷好收纳。","sourceParagraph":10427},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野目光扫过柜子。","sourceParagraph":10428},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「旧线还要留着？」","sourceParagraph":10429},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还能用。」","sourceParagraph":10430},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天不是说要找隔壁家属借。」","sourceParagraph":10431},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲神色微顿。","sourceParagraph":10432},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「人家自己也要用。」","sourceParagraph":10433},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头，柜子角落静静躺着另一根装在透明塑料袋里的廉价数据线。","sourceParagraph":10434},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那这个是什么。」","sourceParagraph":10435},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲的动作僵住一瞬。","sourceParagraph":10436},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「小卖部二十块买的。」","sourceParagraph":10437},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野哭笑不得。","sourceParagraph":10438},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「二十的你就觉得合理，四十九的就嫌贵。」","sourceParagraph":10439},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「二十和四十九本来就不一样。」","sourceParagraph":10440},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你明明自己已经有新的，还让我专门跑一趟买。」","sourceParagraph":10441},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我哪里想到你真的会当真跑去买。」","sourceParagraph":10442},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父子二人四目相对。邻床削苹果的女人溢出一声极轻的笑，想来是无意间听见了这一段拌嘴。两个人同时安静下来，程野微微侧过脸，耳尖漫开一层淡淡的薄红。","sourceParagraph":10443},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三点十分，护士过来通知，医生很快会到病房问诊。","sourceParagraph":10445},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刚才还半靠在椅背上的程野，身体不自觉向前倾，手肘搭住膝盖，双手十指交叠握紧，左手拇指无意识反复摩挲手腕那块旧手表已经开裂的皮表带。","sourceParagraph":10446},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲把他细微的举动尽收眼底。","sourceParagraph":10447},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你总摸它干什么。」","sourceParagraph":10448},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野动作骤然停下。","sourceParagraph":10449},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":10450},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「表带都快要裂开了。」","sourceParagraph":10451},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还能继续用。」","sourceParagraph":10452},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲伸出手。","sourceParagraph":10453},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「拿来我看看。」","sourceParagraph":10454},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野眉头微蹙。","sourceParagraph":10455},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天不是已经看过。」","sourceParagraph":10456},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「再看一眼。」","sourceParagraph":10457},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野不得已，把手腕递过去。父亲指尖捏起那截磨损的表带，指甲轻轻试探裂口。","sourceParagraph":10458},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野飞快把手抽回来。","sourceParagraph":10459},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「别掰，掰断就彻底没法用了。」","sourceParagraph":10460},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一碰就断，那本来就该换新。」","sourceParagraph":10461},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还能撑。」","sourceParagraph":10462},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲淡淡开口：「你这性子又是跟谁学的。」","sourceParagraph":10463},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野微微一怔。","sourceParagraph":10464},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬间脑海闪过刚才那根充电器的小争执，忍不住笑出声。","sourceParagraph":10465},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「跟你学的。」","sourceParagraph":10466},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲啧了一声，身体靠回床头，嘴角却也悄悄浮起一点笑意。","sourceParagraph":10467},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑意尚未完全铺开，门外传来脚步声。程野脸上所有松弛瞬间尽数收敛，身体猛地直起，椅子腿在地板摩擦，发出短促刺耳的轻响。父亲抬眼扫了他一眼，没有多说什么。","sourceParagraph":10468},{"type":"paragraph","text":"医生推门走入病房，身后跟着一名捧着平板的年轻住院医师。邻床削果皮的声响也骤然停下，整个病房一下子被一层紧绷的寂静笼罩。","sourceParagraph":10469},{"type":"paragraph","text":"医生缓缓讲述各项检查情况，程野一开始凝神屏气，努力想要把每一个名词、每一组数值全部牢牢记在心里。可信息接踵而至，繁杂的项目在脑海里交错缠绕，渐渐变得纷乱模糊。他的目光不知不觉飘向床尾那张白色住院信息卡片：姓名，年龄，床号，平平无奇，和隔壁床位没有任何分别。","sourceParagraph":10470},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直到医生沉稳的嗓音落下来。","sourceParagraph":10471},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「目前大家最担心的那一项情况，结合现有结果来看，暂时不予以支持。」","sourceParagraph":10472},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听见这句话，程野一直紧紧攥住表带的手指缓缓松开，皮革被长时间挤压，指腹下留下一道浅浅压痕。","sourceParagraph":10473},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲出声询问：「那意思是没什么大事？」","sourceParagraph":10474},{"type":"paragraph","text":"医生轻轻摇头。","sourceParagraph":10475},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不能说是完全没有问题。有好几项指标依旧异常，后续还有一份报告尚未返回。现阶段不需要立刻采取激进治疗，但是药物需要按时服用，生活作息也要多加留意，到时间回来复查。」","sourceParagraph":10476},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲缓缓点头，神色明显松快不少。","sourceParagraph":10477},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野依旧站在原地。","sourceParagraph":10478},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「剩下那份报告大概多久出来。」","sourceParagraph":10479},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一两天。」","sourceParagraph":10480},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「如果那份报告也没有异常呢。」","sourceParagraph":10481},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就按照现在这套方案继续观察随访。」","sourceParagraph":10482},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「万一报告出现问题呢。」","sourceParagraph":10483},{"type":"paragraph","text":"医生看了看他。","sourceParagraph":10484},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「到时候再根据实际报告调整处理方案。」","sourceParagraph":10485},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野嘴唇抿成一条紧绷的直线，还想继续追问一连串后续设想。父亲抢先开口打断。","sourceParagraph":10486},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我听明白了。」","sourceParagraph":10487},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野转头看向病床。","sourceParagraph":10488},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明白什么。」","sourceParagraph":10489},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等全部报告出来再说。」父亲背靠床头，语气平静，「不要现在把之后十步的问题一股脑全部问完。」","sourceParagraph":10490},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野缄默不语。","sourceParagraph":10491},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一旁的医生不由得浅浅一笑。","sourceParagraph":10492},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「家属心里紧张，这也是人之常情。」","sourceParagraph":10493},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野耳尖泛起热意，默默坐回椅子。","sourceParagraph":10494},{"type":"paragraph","text":"医生又补充几句用药和复查的叮嘱，便带着年轻医师离开。病房房门合上，周遭重归安静。邻床水果刀重新转动，红艳果皮又一点点垂落下来。","sourceParagraph":10495},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲端起水杯喝了一口，语气带着一丝如释重负。","sourceParagraph":10496},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我就说没什么大问题。」","sourceParagraph":10497},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野抬眼望向他，语调平稳，没有火气。","sourceParagraph":10498},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「并不是完全没事。」","sourceParagraph":10499},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲手上动作一顿。","sourceParagraph":10500},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野把医生刚才的话平静复述一遍：「只是眼下不需要紧急处置，还有报告待出，药也必须按时吃。」","sourceParagraph":10501},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「说法上差不多。」","sourceParagraph":10502},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「差得不少。」","sourceParagraph":10503},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野音量不高，态度却很笃定。","sourceParagraph":10504},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲凝视他片刻，没有继续争辩。","sourceParagraph":10505},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「行，就按你说的，不是差不多。」","sourceParagraph":10506},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野紧绷的下颌，这才一点点柔和下来。","sourceParagraph":10507},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三点四十五分，沈砚抵达医院。","sourceParagraph":10509},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野下楼接她，她依旧站在昨日那处靠近住院部大门的位置。今日穿一件简约白衬衫，袖口整齐挽到手肘，手里还攥着一本书，看得出下课之后便直接赶过来。","sourceParagraph":10510},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野朝她走近，沈砚第一眼先望向他的面部神态，捕捉他眉眼之间的情绪。","sourceParagraph":10511},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「结果出来一部分了？」","sourceParagraph":10512},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10513},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「情况怎么样。」","sourceParagraph":10514},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野脚步稍稍停顿。若是换作前几日，他大概会下意识用一句“还好”草草带过。此刻他沉吟片刻，选择如实道出感受。","sourceParagraph":10515},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「比我之前心里预想的要好一些。」","sourceParagraph":10516},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚的神色随之稍稍松弛。","sourceParagraph":10517},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「具体呢。」","sourceParagraph":10518},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「最让人担心的那一项暂时排除，不过还有报告没拿到，后续需要长期吃药、定期回来复查。」","sourceParagraph":10519},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「叔叔本人是什么反应。」","sourceParagraph":10520},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野唇角扯出一点浅淡的苦笑。","sourceParagraph":10521},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他一口咬定算是没事。」","sourceParagraph":10522},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚望着他。","sourceParagraph":10523},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野继续说道：「我跟他纠正过，并不是完全没事。」","sourceParagraph":10524},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那他接受？」","sourceParagraph":10525},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天算是愿意听进去。」","sourceParagraph":10526},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚眼底掠过一丝淡淡的讶异。","sourceParagraph":10527},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「倒是难得。」","sourceParagraph":10528},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人站在住院楼的透明雨棚之下，午后太阳已经向西偏移，顶棚过滤掉刺目的强光，在地面铺下一层柔和的漫射光。来往的家属拿着缴费单据匆匆从二人之间穿行而过，带起一阵转瞬即逝的风。","sourceParagraph":10529},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野开口：「要直接上去病房吗。」","sourceParagraph":10530},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚看向他。","sourceParagraph":10531},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要不要先像昨天那样，绕着后花园走一圈？」","sourceParagraph":10532},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野微微一怔，随即轻轻笑了。","sourceParagraph":10533},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天不必了。」","sourceParagraph":10534},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就上楼。」","sourceParagraph":10535},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回到病房，父亲看见沈砚进门，开口的第一句带着一点打趣：「你又过来了。」语气里并无半分排斥，甚至还下意识把脊背坐得更直几分。","sourceParagraph":10536},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚礼貌颔首：「叔叔。」","sourceParagraph":10537},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲伸手，把床头柜上一袋橘子朝她的方向推过去。","sourceParagraph":10538},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「隔壁床家属给的。」","sourceParagraph":10539},{"type":"paragraph","text":"邻床的中年女人听见，笑着拆穿：「可别往我身上推，明明是你自己下午下楼小卖部买的。」","sourceParagraph":10540},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲的动作瞬间僵住。","sourceParagraph":10541},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野站在一旁，目光落在父亲身上。","sourceParagraph":10542},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「医生都说了，你不宜随便到处走动。」","sourceParagraph":10543},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「又不是什么重体力活。」","sourceParagraph":10544},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那也不能随便下楼乱跑。」","sourceParagraph":10545},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚伸手拿起一只橘子，打断父子之间即将展开的拌嘴。","sourceParagraph":10546},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「谢谢叔叔。」","sourceParagraph":10547},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野涌到嘴边的话语就此卡在喉咙。","sourceParagraph":10548},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲看向程野，眼底藏着一点小小的得胜意味。","sourceParagraph":10549},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你看看人家，懂得收下。」","sourceParagraph":10550},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野皱起眉头。","sourceParagraph":10551},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这跟懂不懂得收下有什么关系。」","sourceParagraph":10552},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「换作是你，第一反应肯定要推辞。」","sourceParagraph":10553},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野张了张嘴，一时竟找不到话反驳。","sourceParagraph":10554},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚坐在椅子上，指尖剥开橘子皮，清脆的果皮裂开，酸甜的果香缓缓弥散开来，稍稍冲淡病房之中挥散不去的消毒水气味。她掰下一瓣果肉递向程野。","sourceParagraph":10555},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野看向递过来的橘瓣。","sourceParagraph":10556},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「给我的？」","sourceParagraph":10557},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯，我吃一半就够。」","sourceParagraph":10558},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野接了过来，没有习惯性客套推辞。","sourceParagraph":10559},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲在一旁端着水杯喝水，目光落在二人身上，嘴角不动声色向上扬了扬。","sourceParagraph":10560},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野捕捉到那抹细微笑意。","sourceParagraph":10561},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你又在笑什么。」","sourceParagraph":10562},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我没有笑。」","sourceParagraph":10563},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你的表情明明就——」","sourceParagraph":10564},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚咽下口中橘瓣，淡淡出声打断争执。","sourceParagraph":10565},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你现在跟叔叔越来越像。」","sourceParagraph":10566},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病房一瞬间安静下来。","sourceParagraph":10567},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野整个人僵在原地。父亲愣过之后，低声笑出声来。","sourceParagraph":10568},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野耳尖迅速发烫。","sourceParagraph":10569},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪里像。」","sourceParagraph":10570},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眼，神色平静。","sourceParagraph":10571},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「两个人都很爱追问别人为什么笑。」","sourceParagraph":10572},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲的笑声愈发清晰。","sourceParagraph":10573},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野捏着手里半只橘子，一时语塞，只能低头咬下一瓣果肉。浓烈的酸意瞬间铺满舌尖，眉头不受控制紧紧皱起。","sourceParagraph":10574},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚看见他的反应。","sourceParagraph":10575},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「很酸？」","sourceParagraph":10576},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野把剩下的半只橘子递还给她。","sourceParagraph":10577},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你自己吃吧。」","sourceParagraph":10578},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不要？」","sourceParagraph":10579},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10580},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲在旁边慢悠悠补了一句：「别浪费食物。」","sourceParagraph":10581},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野转头看向病床。","sourceParagraph":10582},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这是你买的，你来解决。」","sourceParagraph":10583},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我现在不能多吃凉的。」","sourceParagraph":10584},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野来回看了看父亲，又看向沈砚，最后无可奈何，把橘瓣又塞回自己嘴里。","sourceParagraph":10585},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚忍不住弯起唇角。","sourceParagraph":10586},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你笑什么。」程野含着果肉，说话的语调都有些含糊。","sourceParagraph":10587},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚轻轻摇头：「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":10588},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将近五点，父亲的手机忽然响铃。","sourceParagraph":10590},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屏幕来电备注：妈。","sourceParagraph":10591},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是程野的母亲。","sourceParagraph":10592},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的动作猛地顿住。父亲握着手机，指尖微微收紧，铃声一遍一遍持续回荡在病房。他垂着眼，既不按下接听，也不挂断。","sourceParagraph":10593},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野安静看了片刻。","sourceParagraph":10594},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你还没有跟她说这件事？」","sourceParagraph":10595},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲眉头蹙起。","sourceParagraph":10596},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「她怎么会知道住院。」","sourceParagraph":10597},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野立刻澄清：「不是我讲出去的。」","sourceParagraph":10598},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬眼看向他，没有继续追问。","sourceParagraph":10599},{"type":"paragraph","text":"铃声中断，短暂的沉寂过后，再度响起来，依旧是同一个号码。","sourceParagraph":10600},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲的拇指悬停在接听按键上方，迟迟落不下去。","sourceParagraph":10601},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野坐在窗边的椅子上，心底泛起一种无比熟悉的烦躁。前几日的自己，也曾是这般模样：电话响起，既不想接，却又忍不住一次次看向亮起的屏幕。","sourceParagraph":10602},{"type":"paragraph","text":"此刻，轮到父亲陷入这份两难。","sourceParagraph":10603},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野没有开口劝说一句“接吧”，只是平静地开口。","sourceParagraph":10604},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那这件事，你打算让我代为转达吗。」","sourceParagraph":10605},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬眼望向他。","sourceParagraph":10606},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「什么意思。」","sourceParagraph":10607},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「上次我就说得很清楚。」程野的语气沉稳克制，「我不会替你隐瞒，也不会替你去解释你们之间的事情。」","sourceParagraph":10608},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病房外面，传来治疗推车滚轮滚动的规律声响，由远及近，再慢慢飘远。","sourceParagraph":10609},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野继续说道：「如果你想要告诉她，就由你自己来讲。」","sourceParagraph":10610},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲脸上的神色一点点沉落，并非动怒，更像是一时间找不到安放目光的去处。数秒之后，他终于垂下视线，指尖按下接听键。","sourceParagraph":10611},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「喂。」","sourceParagraph":10612},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听见接通的那一瞬间，程野轻轻站起身。沈砚也随之会意，目光看向程野，二人交换一个简短的眼神，程野微微抬下巴示意门口。","sourceParagraph":10613},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两人悄无声息走出病房，把通话留给父亲一个人，不留在门边偷听。","sourceParagraph":10614},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走廊尽头立着一扇大窗，二人走到窗边。五楼的高度，视线越过层层树冠，远处天边的云彩被落日镀上一层柔和的浅金色。住院部庭院里面，不少病患在家属陪伴之下缓步散步，脚步放得很慢。","sourceParagraph":10615},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野双手撑住冰凉的窗台，一言不发。沈砚安静站在身侧，并不主动打探病房里面的谈话内容。","sourceParagraph":10616},{"type":"paragraph","text":"约莫五分钟，程野口袋里的手机开始震动。","sourceParagraph":10617},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来电显示：妈。","sourceParagraph":10618},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野垂眸看向屏幕。","sourceParagraph":10619},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚也瞥见那两个字，保持缄默，不去干预。","sourceParagraph":10620},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野指尖捏着手机，迟疑不过两秒，按下接听。","sourceParagraph":10621},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「妈。」","sourceParagraph":10622},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听筒那头传来急促的女声。","sourceParagraph":10623},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯，我现在在医院。」","sourceParagraph":10624},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是今天才过来，前几天就已经做过一部分检查。」","sourceParagraph":10625},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他停顿片刻，抬手揉了揉发胀的眉心。","sourceParagraph":10626},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不是有意瞒着你。」","sourceParagraph":10627},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音顿住，声音压得更低。","sourceParagraph":10628},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「只是我不知道该怎么开口说这件事。」","sourceParagraph":10629},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落日的暖光斜斜落在他半边侧脸。","sourceParagraph":10630},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「报告还没有全部出来。」","sourceParagraph":10631},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就目前来看，没有需要立刻紧急处理的严重问题。」","sourceParagraph":10632},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他刻意复述刚才医生的原话，避开轻飘飘一句“没事”。","sourceParagraph":10633},{"type":"paragraph","text":"电话那头传来一连串追问。","sourceParagraph":10634},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野后背轻轻靠住窗框。","sourceParagraph":10635},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你想要过来的话，可以过来。」","sourceParagraph":10636},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短暂停顿，他把界限说得明明白白。","sourceParagraph":10637},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不过要不要过来这件事，你自己跟我父亲沟通。」","sourceParagraph":10638},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不会替你们传话斡旋。」","sourceParagraph":10639},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听筒那头又说了些什么，程野的唇角极浅地勾起一点笑意。","sourceParagraph":10640},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「吃过了。」","sourceParagraph":10641},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚眉梢轻轻一动。","sourceParagraph":10642},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野飞快瞥了沈砚一眼，笑意又明显了几分。","sourceParagraph":10643},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「中午吃过的，晚上还没有。」","sourceParagraph":10644},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听筒里继续传来叮嘱。","sourceParagraph":10645},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野轻轻闭了闭眼。","sourceParagraph":10646},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「知道了，我会按时吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":10647},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你也不用太过焦虑。」","sourceParagraph":10648},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就先这样，挂了。」","sourceParagraph":10649},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通话结束，屏幕暗下。","sourceParagraph":10650},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野长长吐出胸中积攒的一口气。","sourceParagraph":10651},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚轻声发问：「阿姨开口第一句问了你什么。」","sourceParagraph":10652},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野看向她。","sourceParagraph":10653},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「质问我为什么现在才通知她。」","sourceParagraph":10654},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「第二句呢。」","sourceParagraph":10655},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「问我有没有好好吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":10656},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚轻轻颔首。","sourceParagraph":10657},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「倒也合乎情理。」","sourceParagraph":10658},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野望着她，半开玩笑地吐槽。","sourceParagraph":10659},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你们是不是私下串通好了，见到我，必先问有没有吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":10660},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚眼底掠过淡淡的笑意。","sourceParagraph":10661},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「大概是你看上去总像没有好好吃过饭。」","sourceParagraph":10662},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低低笑出声，重新返回病房。","sourceParagraph":10663},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推开病房门，父亲静静坐在床沿，手机随意搁在被子表面，既没有把玩，也没有翻看，就那样安安静静放着。眼尾泛开一层淡淡的红，不仔细留意几乎察觉不到。","sourceParagraph":10665},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野把手里的水杯拿起来。","sourceParagraph":10666},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「聊完了？」","sourceParagraph":10667},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲只嗯了一声。","sourceParagraph":10668},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔了一会儿，才缓缓开口。","sourceParagraph":10669},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「她明天会过来。」","sourceParagraph":10670},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野拧瓶盖的动作微微一顿。","sourceParagraph":10671},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":10672},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬眼看向他，带着一点无奈。","sourceParagraph":10673},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你别又是这个“哦”。」","sourceParagraph":10674},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野差点笑出来，强行按捺住。","sourceParagraph":10675},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你是怎么答复她的。」","sourceParagraph":10676},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我说不用特地跑一趟。」父亲语气带着几分无力，「但是她说，来不来是她自己的决定。」","sourceParagraph":10677},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野实在忍不住，浅浅笑开。","sourceParagraph":10678},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚坐在一旁，唇角也有淡淡的弧度。","sourceParagraph":10679},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲看向眼前两个人。","sourceParagraph":10680},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有这么好笑？」","sourceParagraph":10681},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野摇摇头。","sourceParagraph":10682},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没有。」","sourceParagraph":10683},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲冷哼一声。","sourceParagraph":10684},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不知道是跟谁学的这些腔调。」","sourceParagraph":10685},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野没有接话，把水杯递过去。","sourceParagraph":10686},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傍晚时分，第二项检查报告也返回病房。依旧存在部分指标异常，但和医生先前的预判一致，暂时不需要紧急处置。再留院观察一晚，如果明早情况稳定，便可以办理出院。","sourceParagraph":10687},{"type":"paragraph","text":"护士交代完事项离开之后。","sourceParagraph":10688},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲立刻看向程野，一副想要说“你看吧没事”的模样，话到嘴边，硬生生自己咽了回去，改换了说辞。","sourceParagraph":10689},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那明天就可以回家。」","sourceParagraph":10690},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野望着他，没有刻意纠正，只是简单应下。","sourceParagraph":10691},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10692},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一声“嗯”，不再是敷衍搪塞。","sourceParagraph":10693},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚上七点多，二人从医院离开。","sourceParagraph":10695},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜色彻底铺满城市，白日积蓄的地面热气缓缓消散，晚风穿过楼宇缝隙，吹来舒爽的凉意。街边便利店、药店的霓虹招牌次第亮起，层层叠叠的光影把人行道映照得斑斓杂乱。","sourceParagraph":10696},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走出住院部大楼，程野没有像昨天那样，一踏出大门就重重吐出憋闷的气息。他站在台阶之下，下意识回头望了一眼八楼病房的方向，楼层太高，窗户淹没在成片灯火之中，什么都望不见。","sourceParagraph":10697},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚站在一旁等候。","sourceParagraph":10698},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「走吗。」","sourceParagraph":10699},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野轻轻点头。","sourceParagraph":10700},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人路过街边小卖部，程野停下脚步。","sourceParagraph":10701},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等我一下。」","sourceParagraph":10702},{"type":"paragraph","text":"说完便推门走进去，几分钟之后拎着一只小小的纸袋走出来，袋里装着一条新的皮表带。","sourceParagraph":10703},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚垂眸看向纸袋。","sourceParagraph":10704},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是因为叔叔说起你那块旧手表？」","sourceParagraph":10705},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10706},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头看了看手腕上还戴着的旧表。","sourceParagraph":10707},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「其实原来那条还勉强能撑住。」","sourceParagraph":10708},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚望向他。","sourceParagraph":10709},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野立刻辩解：「我知道，不是非要现在换。」","sourceParagraph":10710},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我并没有说什么。」","sourceParagraph":10711},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野被说得一噎，片刻之后自己笑起来，继续往前走。","sourceParagraph":10712},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人就近找了一间小饭馆吃晚饭。程野安安静静点好一份套餐，不再需要旁人反复叮嘱好好吃饭。","sourceParagraph":10713},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚扫过他面前的餐盘。","sourceParagraph":10714},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天很不错。」","sourceParagraph":10715},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野握着筷子的手顿住，有点哭笑不得。","sourceParagraph":10716},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你能不能不要搞得像批改作业。」","sourceParagraph":10717},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「行。」","sourceParagraph":10718},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就不要一直盯着我的盘子。」","sourceParagraph":10719},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚垂下目光，不再看向他的餐盘。","sourceParagraph":10720},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反倒是程野，吃了几口之后主动抬眼。","sourceParagraph":10721},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你吃得太少。」","sourceParagraph":10722},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眸：「你还管上我了。」","sourceParagraph":10723},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野愣了愣，这句对话似曾相识，不由得轻笑出声。","sourceParagraph":10724},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚饭吃到一半，程野开口。","sourceParagraph":10725},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天你不用再过来医院。」","sourceParagraph":10726},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚看向他。","sourceParagraph":10727},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野怕对方误会，立刻补充。","sourceParagraph":10728},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是不想看见你。明天一早情况没问题就要办出院，我母亲也会过来。」","sourceParagraph":10729},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚轻轻点头：「好。」","sourceParagraph":10730},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野安静了一小会儿，心底浮起一丝落空感。刚才的话语说出口，可心里又隐隐生出一点期待。","sourceParagraph":10731},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚捕捉到他神色那一点细微的起伏。","sourceParagraph":10732},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么。」","sourceParagraph":10733},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":10734},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚目光淡淡落在他脸上。","sourceParagraph":10735},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野握着筷子，迟疑片刻，索性不再绕弯子。","sourceParagraph":10736},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「晚上出院之后，要不要一起吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":10737},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚顿了顿。","sourceParagraph":10738},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天？」","sourceParagraph":10739},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10740},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等叔叔安顿妥当之后。」","sourceParagraph":10741},{"type":"paragraph","text":"说出这句话之后，程野的耳尖悄悄发热，他又习惯性想要提前留出退路，话到舌尖又硬生生压下去。","sourceParagraph":10742},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不等沈砚回复，程野自己纠正。","sourceParagraph":10743},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是说随便，我是真心想约你吃晚饭。」","sourceParagraph":10744},{"type":"paragraph","text":"饭馆明亮的灯光落在他泛红的耳廓。","sourceParagraph":10745},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚安静凝望他两秒，轻轻应声。","sourceParagraph":10746},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可以。」","sourceParagraph":10747},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的唇角慢慢舒展，浮起真切松弛的笑意。","sourceParagraph":10748},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那时间明天再定。」","sourceParagraph":10749},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10750},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜晚回到学校，程野才把今日的情况整理之后发给幕，附带一张新表带的照片。","sourceParagraph":10752},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天大概率可以出院。」","sourceParagraph":10753},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕正在宿舍修改论文，看到消息，键盘上的手指停下。","sourceParagraph":10754},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「报告全部没问题吗。」","sourceParagraph":10755},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「最坏的那一项排除，仍有指标异常，后续需要复查吃药。」","sourceParagraph":10756},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看完消息，紧绷许久的肩膀缓缓松快下来。","sourceParagraph":10757},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「知道了。」","sourceParagraph":10758},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔了片刻，程野又发来：「我妈明天也会到医院。」","sourceParagraph":10759},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕：「是叔叔主动联系的？」","sourceParagraph":10760},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「嗯，他自己接的电话，自己沟通。」","sourceParagraph":10761},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕浅浅笑了笑。","sourceParagraph":10762},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「挺好。」","sourceParagraph":10763},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「沈砚今天也过来了。」","sourceParagraph":10764},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕：「是你主动开口邀约的？」","sourceParagraph":10765},{"type":"paragraph","text":"对话框沉寂一小会儿，传回简简单单一个字。","sourceParagraph":10766},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":10767},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕没有再说那句惯常打趣的“有进步”，只是平静回复。","sourceParagraph":10768},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":10769},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二天清晨，办理出院手续的时候，程野的母亲如约抵达病房。","sourceParagraph":10771},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野缴费结束从窗口回来，远远就看见她站在病房门口。阔别许久未见，二人碰面，开口第一句并非寒暄问好。","sourceParagraph":10772},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲眉头紧紧锁起，目光落在父亲身上。","sourceParagraph":10773},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「都瘦成这样了你自己察觉不到？」","sourceParagraph":10774},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲语气淡淡回击。","sourceParagraph":10775},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我本来就是这个身形。」","sourceParagraph":10776},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你多少年没有出现在我面前，当然会觉得不一样。」","sourceParagraph":10777},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，两个人同时顿住。","sourceParagraph":10778},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野站在走廊尽头，没有上前介入，也没有转身回避。春日明亮的日光从走廊窗户倾泻而入，在地面铺出一片片晃眼的亮白。母亲手里拎着一袋水果，父亲身上换回自己那件浅灰色衬衫，病号服已经整齐叠放在病床。","sourceParagraph":10779},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他们就隔着病房门框对峙，两个人脸上都带着岁月刻下的痕迹，比程野记忆之中，又苍老几分。","sourceParagraph":10780},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲率先移开视线。","sourceParagraph":10781},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「药呢，医生交代的药你都收好没有。」","sourceParagraph":10782},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬手指向床头柜。","sourceParagraph":10783},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「袋子都放在那里，上面写清楚吃法。」","sourceParagraph":10784},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你能记得住？」","sourceParagraph":10785},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我还没有糊涂。」","sourceParagraph":10786},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野安静旁观。这一次，不再需要由他站在中间转述消息，不需要替任何一方遮掩、替任何人解释。争执，询问，以后如何联络，全部交由他们两个人自己开口。","sourceParagraph":10787},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头看了一眼手中的缴费回执单，迈步走上前。","sourceParagraph":10788},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「手续办完了。」","sourceParagraph":10789},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人同时转头看向他。","sourceParagraph":10790},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲看向他，开口依旧是那句熟悉的问话。","sourceParagraph":10791},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「早饭吃过没有。」","sourceParagraph":10792},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野轻轻闭了闭眼，浅浅叹出一口气。","sourceParagraph":10793},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲站在一旁，眼底藏着一点克制不住的笑意。","sourceParagraph":10794},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「吃过。」","sourceParagraph":10795},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「吃的什么。」","sourceParagraph":10796},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「包子。」","sourceParagraph":10797},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「吃了几个，豆浆有没有喝。」","sourceParagraph":10798},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲终于忍不住低声笑出来。","sourceParagraph":10799},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野瞪了父亲一眼。","sourceParagraph":10800},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你还笑。」","sourceParagraph":10801},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲摇摇头：「我没笑。」","sourceParagraph":10802},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可嘴角的笑意明明白白挂在脸上。","sourceParagraph":10803},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲也被这一幕逗得唇角微微上扬。","sourceParagraph":10804},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走廊上，运送被服的推车缓缓驶过，轮子碾过地砖，发出规律的滚动声响。日光顺着地板一点点缓缓推移。","sourceParagraph":10805},{"type":"paragraph","text":"检查报告并没有给出一个能把以后所有风雨全部抹平的完美结局。父亲依旧需要长期服药，定期回来复查，下一次复查到来之前，依旧免不了会有忐忑和担忧。","sourceParagraph":10806},{"type":"paragraph","text":"但是至少这一回。","sourceParagraph":10807},{"type":"paragraph","text":"那些本该属于成年人之间的对话，终于，交由他们自己去说。","sourceParagraph":10808},{"type":"image","assetId":"image36","sourceParagraph":10810}],"textChars":9253,"hanChars":7785,"imageCount":1}